      "explanation": "Given, f(x + y) = f(x) + f(y) + xy<sup>2</sup> + x<sup>2</sup>y ...(1)<br><br>differentiating partially with respect to x,<br><br>f'(x+y) = f'(x) + 0 + y<sup>2</sup> + y(2x) [y = constant]<br><br>Put x = 0 and y = x<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> f'(x) = f'(0) + x<sup>2</sup> ....(2)<br><br>putting x = y = 0 at equation (1),<br><br>f(0) = 2f(0)<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.054ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.242ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -525 1000 549\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"21D2\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21D2\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> f(0) = 0<br><br>Given, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.705ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.875ex\" height=\"4.074ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1047.1 5248.9 1800.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"munder\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\" transform=\"translate(38.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"6C\" xl